      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "Gives a genuine axis for grouping reviews by whether the product functions as expected -- directly relevant to identifying purchase aspects. Values are well grounded: AMZ-0004 ('keeps my skin clear', 'gets its job done') is correctly works_as_advertised; the doll/book/music reviews sensibly marked not_present since they discuss content, not functional performance. Reasonable use of not_present for silent rows."
    },
    {
      "name": "quality_durability_issue",
      "analytical_usefulness": 0.8,
      "source_groundedness": 0.9,
      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "Distinct aspect (physical construction/longevity) that adds a separate grouping axis. Sampled rows are all not_present, which is correct behaviour since none of the sampled texts discuss durability. No unsupported assertions observed in samples."
    },
    {
      "name": "content_substance_quality",
      "analytical_usefulness": 0.8,
      "source_groundedness": 0.6,
      "hallucination_observed": true,
      "rationale": "Captures a meaningful aspect for media/book/music products (writing quality, depth), useful for the query. However groundedness is uneven: AMZ-0002 ('some gems but not enough') labeled well_written_substantive is defensible but borderline, and AMZ-0001 (a review about lack of black dolls, not about content substance at all) labeled 'superficial' is an unwarranted read -- the source does not address content quality, so a not_present value would have been correct. This forces a substance judgement where the text is silent."
    },
    {
      "name": "comparison_to_alternatives",
      "analytical_usefulness": 0.85,
      "source_groundedness": 0.85,
      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "Strong analytical axis -- whether reviewers position the product against alternatives is a clear purchase aspect. Sampled values (no_comparison_mentioned / not_present) are consistent with texts that make no explicit competitor comparison. Slight redundancy between 'no_comparison_mentioned' and 'not_present' categories but grounding is sound."
    }
  ],
  "analytical_usefulness": 0.82,
  "source_groundedness": 0.78,
  "rationale": "The four added columns each supply a distinct, non-trivial aspect axis (functional performance, physical durability, content quality, competitive comparison) that directly serves the query of identifying what reviewers discuss -- none are near-constant restatements or bare sentiment flags. Groundedness is mostly sound: extraction/categorisation aligns with source text and silent rows are reasonably marked not_present. The main weakness is content_substance_quality forcing substantive-quality labels onto rows whose text does not discuss content (e.g. AMZ-0001), a mild hallucination that lowers overall groundedness."
